---
import Layout from '../layouts/Landing.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy · Fundament"
  description="What this site measures, where the statistics run, and how to opt out. No cookies, no third parties."
>
  <nldd-simple-section width="800px">
    <nldd-rich-text>
      <h1>Privacy</h1>
      <p>
        This site counts visits so we can see which documentation gets read. It does so without
        cookies, without profiles and without third parties.
      </p>

      <h2>What is measured</h2>
      <p>
        For each visit: the page and its title, the referring site, browser, operating system,
        device type, screen size, language, country and region derived from your IP address, and the
        time.
      </p>
      <p>
        Your IP address is not stored. It is used to look up the location and to compute a visitor
        ID, a one-way hash that rotates periodically, and is then discarded.
      </p>

      <h2>Where it runs</h2>
      <p>
        The statistics run on <a href="https://umami.is/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >Umami</a
        >, open-source software hosted by the Fundament team on its own Kubernetes cluster in Europe. The data
        is not shared, sold or used for advertising.
      </p>

      <h2>Opting out</h2>
      <p>
        Any common tracker or ad blocker blocks the script. The site works exactly the same without
        it.
      </p>
    </nldd-rich-text>
  </nldd-simple-section>
</Layout>

<script>
  import '@nldd/design-system/simple-section';
  import '@nldd/design-system/rich-text';
</script>
